#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:8
msgid "How to run, configure, and implement a Satellite app that speaks SAP."
msgstr "如何运行、配置并实现使用 SAP 的 Satellite 应用。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:10
msgid "## Deployment modes"
msgstr "## 部署模式"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:12
msgid "Hub learns about Satellites in two ways:"
msgstr "Hub 通过两种方式发现 Satellite："

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:14
msgid "### Managed (config + systemd)"
msgstr "### 托管（配置 + systemd）"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:16
msgid ""
"Declare a process in `~/.anima/config.yaml`. `anima service start/stop/"
"restart` writes `anima-satellite-<name>.service` user units (when systemd is "
"available) and starts/stops them with `anima.service`."
msgstr ""
"在 `~/.anima/config.yaml` 中声明进程。`anima service start/stop/restart` 会写"
"入 `anima-satellite-<name>.service` 用户单元（在 systemd 可用时），并与 "
"`anima.service` 一同启动/停止它们。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:33
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```yaml\n"
"satellites:\n"
"  parlor:\n"
"    enabled: true\n"
"    command: bun\n"
"    args: [\"satellites/parlor/dev.ts\"]\n"
"    env:\n"
"      SATELLITE_PORT: \"4174\"\n"
"  pair-programming:\n"
"    enabled: true\n"
"    command: bun\n"
"    args: [\"satellites/pair-programming/dev.ts\"]\n"
"    env:\n"
"      STUDIO_WORKSPACE: /path/to/project\n"
"      SATELLITE_PORT: \"4173\"\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""
"```yaml\n"
"satellites:\n"
"  parlor:\n"
"    enabled: true\n"
"    command: bun\n"
"    args: [\"satellites/parlor/dev.ts\"]\n"
"    env:\n"
"      SATELLITE_PORT: \"4174\"\n"
"  pair-programming:\n"
"    enabled: true\n"
"    command: bun\n"
"    args: [\"satellites/pair-programming/dev.ts\"]\n"
"    env:\n"
"      STUDIO_WORKSPACE: /path/to/project\n"
"      SATELLITE_PORT: \"4173\"\n"
"```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:38
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Field | Role |\n"
"| ----- | ---- |\n"
"| `command` / `args` | Process to run (required for managed satellites) |\n"
"| `env` | Extra environment variables |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 字段 | 作用 |\n"
"| ----- | ---- |\n"
"| `command` / `args` | 要运行的进程（托管卫星必填） |\n"
"| `env` | 额外环境变量 |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:40
msgid ""
"Working directory is derived by anima from the install layout (monorepo root "
"or CLI package root), not configured here."
msgstr ""
"工作目录由 anima 根据安装布局（monorepo 根目录或 CLI 包根目录）推导，不在此处"
"配置。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:42
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Startup:** managed satellites start only after Hub `GET /api/health` returns `status: ok`.\n"
msgstr "**启动：** 托管卫星仅在 Hub `GET /api/health` 返回 `status: ok` 之后才会启动。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:44
msgid ""
"See [service.md](../guide/service.md) for systemd unit paths and startup "
"order."
msgstr ""
"有关 systemd 单元路径与启动顺序，见 [service.md](../guide/service.md)。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:46
msgid "### Dynamic (SAP connect)"
msgstr "### 动态（SAP 连接）"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:48
msgid ""
"No `command` in config. Start the satellite yourself; it connects to Hub via "
"SAP WebSocket. Instances appear on Chamber → Satellites after connect."
msgstr ""
"配置中不写 `command`。自行启动卫星；它通过 SAP WebSocket 连接 Hub。连接后实例"
"会出现在卧室 → 卫星中。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:50
msgid "There is **no** global `studio:` section in `config.yaml`."
msgstr "`config.yaml` 中**没有**全局 `studio:` 段。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:52
msgid ""
"Open managed satellite UI at the URL from Chamber (SAP `http_url`), "
"typically:"
msgstr "在卧室提供的 URL（SAP `http_url`）打开托管卫星 UI，通常为："

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:55
msgid "Parlor: `http://127.0.0.1:4174`"
msgstr "会客厅：`http://127.0.0.1:4174`"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:55
msgid "Pair-programming: `http://127.0.0.1:4173`"
msgstr "结对编程：`http://127.0.0.1:4173`"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:57
msgid "## Architecture patterns"
msgstr "## 架构模式"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:80
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```mermaid\n"
"flowchart TB\n"
"  subgraph browser [Browser]\n"
"    UI[Satellite UI]\n"
"  end\n"
"  subgraph satelliteProcess [Satellite process]\n"
"    HTTP[HTTP server]\n"
"    HubApi[hub-api proxy]\n"
"    SapClient[SAP client runSapTransport]\n"
"    LocalTools[Local tool handlers]\n"
"  end\n"
"  subgraph hub [Hub]\n"
"    SapWs[\"/sap/v1\"]\n"
"    Runtime[AgentRuntime]\n"
"  end\n"
"  UI --> HTTP\n"
"  HTTP --> HubApi\n"
"  HubApi --> SapClient\n"
"  SapClient --> SapWs\n"
"  SapWs --> Runtime\n"
"  SapClient --> LocalTools\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""
"```mermaid\n"
"flowchart TB\n"
"  subgraph browser [Browser]\n"
"    UI[Satellite UI]\n"
"  end\n"
"  subgraph satelliteProcess [Satellite process]\n"
"    HTTP[HTTP server]\n"
"    HubApi[hub-api proxy]\n"
"    SapClient[SAP client runSapTransport]\n"
"    LocalTools[Local tool handlers]\n"
"  end\n"
"  subgraph hub [Hub]\n"
"    SapWs[\"/sap/v1\"]\n"
"    Runtime[AgentRuntime]\n"
"  end\n"
"  UI --> HTTP\n"
"  HTTP --> HubApi\n"
"  HubApi --> SapClient\n"
"  SapClient --> SapWs\n"
"  SapWs --> Runtime\n"
"  SapClient --> LocalTools\n"
"```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:82
msgid "### Parlor satellite"
msgstr "### 会客厅卫星"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:84
msgid ""
"Browser connects to Hub via SAP WebSocket from the client ([`browser-"
"client.ts`](../../packages/sap-contract/src/browser-client.ts)); static "
"server only serves UI + `/config.json`. No server-side hub-api proxy."
msgstr ""
"浏览器通过客户端中的 SAP WebSocket 连接 Hub（[`browser-client.ts`](../../"
"packages/sap-contract/src/browser-client.ts)）；静态服务器仅提供 UI 与 `/"
"config.json`。无服务端 hub-api 代理。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:86
msgid "### Pair-programming satellite"
msgstr "### 结对编程卫星"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:88
msgid ""
"HTTP API forwards to SAP RPC; SSE streams map from SAP `stream.*` events. "
"Terminal WebSocket bridges to SAP `terminal.*`."
msgstr ""
"HTTP API 转发至 SAP RPC；SSE 流映射自 SAP `stream.*` 事件。终端 WebSocket 桥"
"接到 SAP `terminal.*`。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:95
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```mermaid\n"
"sequenceDiagram\n"
"  participant Browser\n"
"  participant HTTP as Satellite HTTP\n"
"  participant SAP as SapClient\n"
"  participant Hub as Hub\n"
msgstr ""
"```mermaid\n"
"sequenceDiagram\n"
"  participant Browser\n"
"  participant HTTP as Satellite HTTP\n"
"  participant SAP as SapClient\n"
"  participant Hub as Hub\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:111
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  Browser->>HTTP: POST /api/sessions\n"
"  HTTP->>SAP: request session.create\n"
"  SAP->>Hub: req session.create\n"
"  Hub->>SAP: res session_id\n"
"  SAP->>HTTP: session_id\n"
"  HTTP->>Browser: JSON response\n"
"  Browser->>HTTP: POST /api/messages SSE\n"
"  HTTP->>SAP: request message.send\n"
"  SAP->>Hub: req message.send\n"
"  loop stream events\n"
"    Hub-->>SAP: evt stream.*\n"
"    SAP-->>HTTP: map to SSE\n"
"    HTTP-->>Browser: SSE event\n"
"  end\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""
"  Browser->>HTTP: POST /api/sessions\n"
"  HTTP->>SAP: request session.create\n"
"  SAP->>Hub: req session.create\n"
"  Hub->>SAP: res session_id\n"
"  SAP->>HTTP: session_id\n"
"  HTTP->>Browser: JSON response\n"
"  Browser->>HTTP: POST /api/messages SSE\n"
"  HTTP->>SAP: request message.send\n"
"  SAP->>Hub: req message.send\n"
"  loop stream events\n"
"    Hub-->>SAP: evt stream.*\n"
"    SAP-->>HTTP: map to SSE\n"
"    HTTP-->>Browser: SSE event\n"
"  end\n"
"```\n"

