#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:119
msgid "## Minimal SAP client"
msgstr "## 最小 SAP 客户端"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:121
msgid "Use `runSapTransport` from `@freeanima/sap-contract`:"
msgstr "使用 `@freeanima/sap-contract` 中的 `runSapTransport`："

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:124
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "```typescript import { runSapTransport } from \"@freeanima/sap-contract;"
msgid ""
"```typescript import { runSapTransport } from \"@freeanima/sap-contract\";"
msgstr ""
"```typescript import { runSapTransport } from \"@freeanima/sap-contract;"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:141
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"const transport = runSapTransport({\n"
"  hubUrl: process.env.FREEANIMA_URL ?? \"http://127.0.0.1:2658\",\n"
"  connect: {\n"
"    app_id: \"my-app\",\n"
"    instance_id: process.env.SATELLITE_INSTANCE_ID ?? crypto.randomUUID(),\n"
"    features_requested: [\"server_info\"],\n"
"    http_url: `http://127.0.0.1:${process.env.SATELLITE_PORT ?? 4173}`,\n"
"  },\n"
"  onConnected: async (client) => {\n"
"    client.onEvent(\"tool.call\", (payload) => {\n"
"      /* handle */\n"
"    });\n"
"    await client.request(\"tool.register\", { tools: [/* ... */] });\n"
"  },\n"
"});\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""
"const transport = runSapTransport({\n"
"  hubUrl: process.env.FREEANIMA_URL ?? \"http://127.0.0.1:2658\",\n"
"  connect: {\n"
"    app_id: \"my-app\",\n"
"    instance_id: process.env.SATELLITE_INSTANCE_ID ?? crypto.randomUUID(),\n"
"    features_requested: [\"server_info\"],\n"
"    http_url: `http://127.0.0.1:${process.env.SATELLITE_PORT ?? 4173}`,\n"
"  },\n"
"  onConnected: async (client) => {\n"
"    client.onEvent(\"tool.call\", (payload) => {\n"
"      /* handle */\n"
"    });\n"
"    await client.request(\"tool.register\", { tools: [/* ... */] });\n"
"  },\n"
"});\n"
"```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:143
msgid ""
"Transport handles WebSocket open, `connect` handshake, heartbeat, and "
"reconnect with exponential backoff."
msgstr ""
"Transport 负责 WebSocket 打开、`connect` 握手、心跳，以及带指数退避的重连。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:145
msgid "## Environment variables"
msgstr "## 环境变量"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:153
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Variable | Role |\n"
"| -------- | ---- |\n"
"| `FREEANIMA_URL` | Hub HTTP base URL |\n"
"| `SATELLITE_PORT` | Satellite HTTP listen port |\n"
"| `SATELLITE_INSTANCE_ID` | Stable instance id (optional; random if unset) |\n"
"| `STUDIO_WORKSPACE` | Pair-programming workspace root |\n"
"| `STUDIO_GITIGNORE` / `STUDIO_SHOW_HIDDEN` | File tree filters |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 变量 | 作用 |\n"
"| -------- | ---- |\n"
"| `FREEANIMA_URL` | Hub HTTP 基础 URL |\n"
"| `SATELLITE_PORT` | Satellite HTTP 监听端口 |\n"
"| `SATELLITE_INSTANCE_ID` | 稳定实例 ID（可选；未设置时随机生成） |\n"
"| `STUDIO_WORKSPACE` | 结对编程工作区根目录 |\n"
"| `STUDIO_GITIGNORE` / `STUDIO_SHOW_HIDDEN` | 文件树过滤器 |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:155
msgid "## Layer dependencies"
msgstr "## 层依赖"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:157
msgid ""
"Per [`scripts/check-layer-deps.ts`](../../scripts/check-layer-deps.ts): "
"`satellites/*` may depend only on `@freeanima/sap-contract` and `@freeanima/"
"kernel`. Do not import platform or runtime packages from Satellite code."
msgstr ""
"依据 [`scripts/check-layer-deps.ts`](../../scripts/check-layer-deps.ts)："
"`satellites/*` 只能依赖 `@freeanima/sap-contract` 与 `@freeanima/kernel`。请"
"勿在 Satellite 代码中导入 platform 或 runtime 包。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:159
msgid "## Chamber visibility"
msgstr "## 卧室可见性"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:161
msgid ""
"`GET /api/satellites/status` (Chamber → Satellites) reads "
"`SatelliteManager.getStatus()`: connected instances, `http_url`, registered "
"tools, heartbeat timestamps."
msgstr ""
"`GET /api/satellites/status`（卧室 → 卫星）读取 "
"`SatelliteManager.getStatus()`：已连接实例、`http_url`、已注册工具、心跳时间"
"戳。"

